just: ∵ COORDINATES | HOMOGENEOUS COORDINATES | On acute triangle (5, 6, 7), perpendiculars are 1 : 1 : 1 and sub-areas are 5 : 6 : 7 (27.8% : 33.3% : 38.9%).
say: [sfx:ratio] Equidistant from sidelines B C, C A, and A B by the inradius r, <pause> its trilinear coordinates are one, to one, to one, <pause> while its barycentric sub-areas scale directly with the side lengths, <pause> a, to b, to c.

